// Zones. `start` is in WoW coordinates (x, y, z), `map` the Map.dbc id. The spawner keeps
// `alive_start` enemies around the heroes at first, `alive_per_minute` more each minute up to
// `alive_max`, one every `spawn_every` seconds, between `spawn_ring` yards away. A spawn entry's
// `after` is the second of the run it first can come.
